XB-Kidux-Ages: 2-10
Description: Kidux learning module: GCompris, over a hundred activities for ages two to ten
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is GCompris: over a hundred educational activities for children
 from two to ten, reading, counting, colours, the keyboard and the mouse,
 in the child's language. With an internet connection it fetches its
 voices and word pictures on its own.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
